  "about": "Hand-authored mapping from source ids to the size and palette authorities. scaleRow names a row of art/catalogue/scale_chart.json (or a size_classes.json race row); ramps name ramps of game/data/DEUS_PaletteRegistry.json. basis MATCH = the source names the same thing as the chart row / ramp (for example oak -> TREE_COMMON_OAK); basis PROPOSED = the nearest row or ramp chosen by the catalogue writer because no row or ramp names the thing. Every PROPOSED line is counted in docs/art/catalogue/INDEX.md and listed as an Owner question in conflicts.md. band is only given where the builder cannot compute it from the WorldCatalog biome tables (surface biomes -> SURFACE, undergroundBiomes -> LOWER1 by containment of the legacy levels -1/-2, both -> ALL, tag building -> ALL).",
